abstract: >-
  sel2pw is an open-source Node.js package that performs deterministic,
  AST-based migration of legacy Selenium test suites (Java + TestNG/JUnit/Cucumber
  and C# + NUnit/SpecFlow) to compiling Playwright TypeScript. Validated against
  15 real-world OSS Selenium repositories totalling 409 Java source files with
  zero failed conversions: 150 cleanly converted, 152 stubbed with migration
  recipes, 11 honestly skipped (POJO-shaped). Produces CONVERSION_REVIEW.md
  (line-level punch list) and MIGRATION_NOTES.md (project-wide guidance).
